# Journey › Stage 1 driven with the gas held to the flag (the score breakdown and the First Finish
# achievement); Next stage starts Stage 2, which pauses and resumes, then quits to a title that
# now offers Quick play — Stage 2.
until 300 Hillwheel
frames 150
click Journey. 40 stages
until 60 =Stage 1
frames 10
save journey
click =Stage 1
until 120 m to the flag
hold KeyW
until 1500 Finished!
release KeyW
frames 20
expect Achievements: First Finish
expect Time bonus
save stage-1-results
click =Next stage
until 120 m to the flag
frames 400
key Escape 2
until 60 Resume
frames 10
save stage-2-paused
click =Resume
frames 60
key Escape 2
until 60 Quit to title
frames 10
click =Quit to title
until 120 Quick play — Stage 2
frames 10
save title-after
